1
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:04,060
剪刀石头布
Okay, Rock Paper Scissors.

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:06,520
输的人去第12桌穿短裤的客人说
Loser has to ask the guy in gym shorts at table 12

3
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,900
请停止莎朗·斯通[分享]他的蛋蛋
to stop Sharon Stoneing us his balls.

4
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:17,400
从我们得进行这对话来说
By virtue of having this conversation,

5
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,400
咱俩都是输家吧
aren't we both losers?

6
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:22,119
瞧瞧是谁从好莱坞回来了
Look who's back from Hollywood.

7
00:00:22,119 --> 00:00:25,411
这不是黑寡妇与詹妮佛·洛佩茨吗
If it isn't ScarJo and J-Lo.

8
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,260
她詹·洛你还沾屎呢
Said the guy from down low.

9
