Han, don't be upset just because I'm about to make $250,000

12
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:40,960
以我人生而拍的电影 就眼红吃醋好吗
and have a movie made about me.

13
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,680
阿憨早就有一部以他为原型的电影了
Han already had a movie made about him...

14
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,140
《小[百]货战警》
"Paul Blart: Small Cop."

15
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:48,760
那你那部电影叫什么
What's your movie called?

16
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:50,300
《冲进失业区》[冲出康普顿]吗
"Straight Outta A Job"?

17
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:05,160
