Ah, screw it.

48
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:25,860
我明天肯定有罪受 但是...
I'm gonna feel this tomorrow, but mm, mm!

49
00:02:30,220 --> 00:02:31,260
大家安安
Hey, everybody!

50
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,300
今天是我跟奥列格要知晓
Today's the day Oleg and me find out

51
