蓝色就是男孩"斯威特兰尼"
And blue if it's a Svetlenny.

75
00:03:39,420 --> 00:03:42,520
已经比我波兰老家那里好了
Well, it beats the way they did it in my town in Poland.

76
00:03:42,900 --> 00:03:44,480
你要么是个男孩
You were either a boy

77
