Which is sweet, delicious, and expensive?

109
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,980
我们保留小蛋糕窗口
We keep the cupcake window,

110
00:05:20,980 --> 00:05:23,200
但再把它变成一家酒吧
but we make it into a bar too.

111
00:05:24,100 --> 00:05:26,440
