不过你说得对
but yes!

115
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,640
保留小蛋糕梦
We keep the cupcake dream;

116
00:05:34,700 --> 00:05:37,080
只是加上特贵的酒
we just add overpriced alcohol to it.

117
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,700
我爱这点子
I love it!

118
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,900
我们可以称其为小蛋糕鸡尾酒
We can call it Cupcakes & Cocktails.

119
00:05:41,420 --> 00:05:43,480
如果我们不想显得太讨人厌
Or, if we want to be less douchey,

120
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,120
那就叫做甜点吧
we call it Dessert Bar.

121
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,760
这点子太聪明了
That is a genius idea.

122
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:51,040
通常你喝醉的时候 你最好的点子就是
Usually when you're drunk, your best idea is,

