132
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:19,700
我刚从医生那里回来
Oh, I just came back from the doctor,

133
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:22,740
我手里拿着宝宝的性别 但我不想看到
and I have the sex of the baby, but I don't want to see it.

134
