147
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:59,180
哪怕我求你 也别告诉我
Even if I beg you, don't tell me.

148
00:06:59,620 --> 00:07:00,140
好的
Okay.

149
00:07:00,500 --> 00:07:02,980
就算我大半夜下楼来你家
Even if I come downstairs in the middle of the night

150
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:04,400
拿着枪指着你的头
and put a gun to your head,

151
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,240
也别说
don't tell me.

152
