171
00:08:06,860 --> 00:08:10,620
* 我蛋蛋的铁窗 *
* Steel bars on our balls *

172
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:13,940
* 这监狱的铁窗 *
* Steel bars on this jail *

173
00:08:13,940 --> 00:08:15,720
* 而且无法保释 *
* And there ain't no bail

174
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:18,900
* 没人打来慰问 *
* And nobody calls *

175
00:08:19,460 --> 00:08:21,820
我每周打给他两次呢
I call him twice a week.

176
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:25,000
* 咱蛋蛋的铁窗 *
* Steel bars on our balls *

177
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:28,360
* 咱蛋蛋的铁窗 *
* Steel bars on our balls *

178
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:31,230
* 咱蛋蛋的铁窗 *
* Steel bars on our balls *

179
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:32,801
* 铁窗 *
* Steel bars *

180
00:08:32,801 --> 00:08:36,793
* 在咱的蛋蛋上 *
* On our baaaaaalls *

181
00:08:37,380 --> 00:08:40,560
太他妈赞了
Oh, hell, yes!

182
00:08:42,999 --> 00:08:45,800
* 25年到终身监禁 *
* 25 to life *

183
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:49,760
* 疼痛与争执无数 *
* Lots of pain and plenty of strife *

184
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:52,920
* 孤独如刀般锋利 *
* Loneliness, it cuts like a knife *

185
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:58,542
* 25年到终身监禁 *
* 25 to liiiiiife *

186
00:09:01,980 --> 00:09:05,020
谢谢 谢谢大家
Thank you. Thank you so much. Wow.

187
00:09:05,020 --> 00:09:08,080
我们不会把各位"关"在这里太久
Well, we won't keep you prisoner much longer.

188
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:11,460
简短的幕间休息后
So we're just gonna take a brief intermission,

189
00:09:11,460 --> 00:09:13,600
我们将回来演出下半场
and we'll be back with the second half.

190
00:09:15,420 --> 00:09:17,600
什么下半场 刚才都三小时了
Second half? That was three hours!

191
00:09:19,540 --> 00:09:21,960
太棒了 爸爸
That was incredible, Dad!

192
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:24,080
尤其是试图逃狱的那一幕
Especially the escape attempt scene.

193
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:26,860
那一幕的暴力场景看起来特别真
Some of that violence looked incredibly realistic.

194
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,760
因为那是真的 不是剧情
That was because it was real, not part of the show.

195
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:30,860
警卫把那犯人打了个半死
They beat that guy severely.

196
00:09:33,500 --> 00:09:34,432
* 铁窗 *
* Steel bars *

197
00:09:34,432 --> 00:09:37,660
噔噔 什么什么的
Da-dum, something, something.

198
00:09:37,660 --> 00:09:39,780
马丁 我要在你身上加上新的两项罪名
Martin, I'm gonna add two more crimes to your prison sentence:

199
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:42,970
偷走我的心 与偷走全场目光焦点
stealing my heart and stealing the show.

200
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:45,020
能在我节目单上签名吗
Can you sign my playbill?

201
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,160
卡洛琳 拿出我的节目单
Caroline, get my playbill.

202
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:48,540
这里 帮我拿一下苏菲的揭开性别信封
Oh, here. Hold Sophie's gender reveal envelope.

203
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,520
还有这个我拿来当做钱包的信封
Oh, and this envelope I use as a wallet.

204
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:52,740
还有我拿来当做化妆包的信封
And this other envelope I use as a makeup bag.

205
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:54,780
在这里
Oh, here it is.

206
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,840
我只能用蜡笔给你签名
Great. I'm gonna use my crayon.

207
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:58,360
我们不能拥有笔
We can't have pens.

208
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:01,060
来 也签我的
Oh, here. Sign mine too.

209
00:10:01,180 --> 00:10:03,060
我会把这签名放在我裱框起来
I'll put it next to that framed picture I have

210
00:10:03,060 --> 00:10:04,880
你跟早年还支持自由党的川普合照的照片旁
of you and Donald Trump when he was a liberal.

211
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,940
好了 说够我的事了
Well, enough about me.

212
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:09,200
谁要在你的电影里演我呢 宝贝
Who's playing me in your movie, hon?

213
00:10:09,420 --> 00:10:11,620
别找布拉德·皮特 太像我了
Not Brad Pitt. It's too on the nose.

214
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,580
他们还没开始选角
Well, they haven't cast it yet,

215
00:10:14,580 --> 00:10:18,140
但他们会付给我25万来买我的故事
but they are giving me $250,000 for my story.

216
00:10:19,540 --> 00:10:21,120
宝贝 这就是你的入门票
Honey, this is your ticket.

217
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,460
你可以开始自己的生意了
Now you can start your own business.

218
00:10:22,820 --> 00:10:24,700
我跟麦克斯有自己的生意了啊
I have my own business with Max.

219
00:10:24,980 --> 00:10:25,760
小蛋糕生意吗
The cupcakes?

220
00:10:28,300 --> 00:10:30,540
我承认生意最近有些淡
I'll admit business has been slow.

221
00:10:30,620 --> 00:10:31,880
但我们会用这笔钱
But we're gonna use the money

222
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:33,400
把我们的生意带到下一个阶段
to take our business to the next level.

223
00:10:33,660 --> 00:10:37,820
麦克斯有个天才点子 把蛋糕店改成甜点吧
Max had the genius idea of making it a dessert bar.

224
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,560
我们还是会卖小蛋糕
We still sell our cupcakes,

225
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:41,560
但我们也卖高档鸡尾酒
but we also serve high-end cocktails.

226
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:43,200
只要加上"混合"这个字
You can just say the word "muddle"

227
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,360
就能卖20块
and charge $20.

228
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:48,800
姑娘们 这个点子太棒了
That is a fantastic idea, ladies.

229
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,060
棒极了
Wow, it's so great.

230
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:52,380
亲爱的 能帮我去那点水吗
Honey, do me a favor. Could you get me some water?

231
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:54,480
我想为明早的戏保持水分充足
I want to stay hydrated for tomorrow's matinee.

232
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:57,800
道上传闻罗伯特·德斯特专门转狱来看呢
There's talk of Robert Durst transferring in just to see it,

233
00:10:57,800 --> 00:10:59,160
说出来我怕会有"厄运" 就不会实现了
and I don't want to jinx it, you know.

234
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,800
想甩开傻子单独谈是吗
Wanted to ditch the square, huh?

235
00:11:06,900 --> 00:11:08,060
我明白
I get it.

236
00:11:08,300 --> 00:11:09,459
这事终于要来了吗
Is this finally happening?

237
00:11:09,459 --> 00:11:12,198
为庆祝要亲热一发吗
Celebration make-out sesh?

238
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,940
我们得把双手放在他们看得到的地方
Uh, yeah, we got to keep our hands in plain view.

239
00:11:17,100 --> 00:11:19,660
小蛋糕的生意根本不适合卡洛琳
This whole cupcake business is not for Caroline.

240
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,880
做蛋糕的又不是她 是我
Well, she's not the baker; I am.

241
00:11:21,900 --> 00:11:23,060
她负责创意
She's the idea person.

242
00:11:23,060 --> 00:11:25,360
但甜点吧这个点子不是你想的吗
Yeah, but you had the dessert bar idea, right?

243
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:28,180
而你刚才也说这是一个超棒的点子
And you just said it was a terrific idea.

244
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,880
你也看见了
Well, as you saw...

245
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:31,820
我是一名好演员
I'm a really good actor.

246
00:11:33,660 --> 00:11:34,940
我能挠挠鼻子吗
Can I itch my nose?

247
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:39,780
听着 我的宝贝在华尔街长大
Look, my baby was brought up around Wall Street.

248
00:11:39,780 --> 00:11:41,440
接受沃顿商学院教育
She's Wharton bred.

249
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:44,880
卖小蛋糕这种小生意 永远不可能让她开心
She could never be happy doing this whole baking business,

250
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,880
这次是她解脱的大好机遇
and this is her big chance to get out.

251
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:48,900
但她难道不会自己跟我说吗
But wouldn't she have told me?

252
00:11:49,180 --> 00:11:51,900
她有任何想法都会跟我说
She tells me every single feeling she's having.

253
00:11:51,900 --> 00:11:53,800
有一些我甚至还听进去了
And some of it, I even listen to.

254
00:11:54,980 --> 00:11:56,500
那如果我直接问她呢
What if I just ask her?

255
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:58,060
她只会否认
She'll only deny it.

256
00:11:58,060 --> 00:11:59,320
她不想让你伤心
She doesn't want to hurt your feelings.

257
00:11:59,620 --> 00:12:00,760
所以我来帮她说
That's why I'm doing it.

258
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:03,180
但她说过甜点吧让她开心不已
But she said she was happy about the dessert bar.

259
00:12:03,220 --> 00:12:04,360
我们开心得跳舞了呢
We danced about it.

260
00:12:04,460 --> 00:12:06,240
麦克斯 听我说
Max, listen to me.

261
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,760
我是她爸 我了解她
I'm her father, and I know her.

262
00:12:09,300 --> 00:12:10,580
这次是她的大好机遇
And this is her big chance.

263
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:11,980
你就放手让她走吧
You just got to let her go.

264
00:12:12,980 --> 00:12:13,660
真的要这样吗
I do?

265
00:12:13,860 --> 00:12:15,780
是的 你一定要态度坚决
Yeah, and you got to be firm about it,

266
00:12:15,780 --> 00:12:16,960
不然她不会明白
or she's not going to get the message.

267
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,960
就像电影《鬼驱人》
Like in "Poltergeist,"

268
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:21,160
他们不得不严厉管教他们的小女儿
where they have to be really stern with Carol Anne

269
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:22,700
否则她就会那只鬼厮混在一起
or else she'll stay with the ghosts?

270
00:12:24,380 --> 00:12:26,000
而我就是那只鬼吗
And I'm the ghosts?

271
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:35,420
麦克斯 你怎么了
Max, what is going on with you?

272
00:12:35,500 --> 00:12:36,080
你没事吧
Are you all right?

273
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:37,980
没事
I'm fine.

274
00:12:38,380 --> 00:12:40,320
我在给苏菲做性别蛋糕
I'm just making Sophie's gender cake.

275
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:42,300
如果你不想待在这里 那就回华尔街啊
If you don't want to be here, go back to Wall Street.

276
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:43,800
什么
What?

277
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,180
你到底怎么回事
What is going on with you?

278
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:48,480
从我们离开监狱 你就一直气扑扑的
You've been pouty ever since we left the prison.

279
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,100
如果是因为不舍得走所以不爽
I'm not gonna take you there anymore

280
00:12:50,100 --> 00:12:51,300
那下次不带你去了
if you're sad to leave.

281
00:12:52,260 --> 00:12:53,480
你懂个屁啊
You know what?

282
00:12:54,020 --> 00:12:56,290
老娘在忙着干所有的活
While I'm doing all the work,

283
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:59,300
你去帮我把那个有性别的信封拿过来
why don't you go get me the gender envelope?

284
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:02,300
好的 易怒的大忙人
Okay, Moody Giuliani.

285
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:10,160
别告诉我你把那个里面有
Do not tell me you lost the envelope

286
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:12,140
苏菲宝宝性别的信封弄丢了
with the gender of Sophie's baby in there.

287
00:13:12,220 --> 00:13:14,000
我没有弄丢了
I didn't lose it.

288
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:15,400
只是它不在我这儿
I just don't have it,

289
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:17,180
我也不知道它在哪儿
and I don't know where it is.

290
00:13:18,700 --> 00:13:20,560
很可能是你让我把节目单拿出来时
Oh, we probably left it at the prison

291
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:21,960
不小心把它落在监狱了
when you made me get out the playbill.

292
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:24,200
所以这是我的错吗
Oh, so this is my fault.

293
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:26,560
你只需要把这一件事做好 你却搞砸了
The one thing you had to do, you didn't do.

294
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:29,140
就像素食餐厅里的服务员
Like a waitress at a vegan restaurant,

295
00:13:29,380 --> 00:13:31,100
你端上桌的东西[贡献]跟没有一样
you're bringing almost nothing to the table.

296
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:36,720
我可是贡献了25万美金啊
The $250,000 I'm bringing to the table,

297
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:37,520
那也叫没有吗
that's nothing?

298
00:13:37,780 --> 00:13:39,960
所以那是你的钱
Oh, so that's your money.

299
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:41,280
终于说出来了
There it is.

300
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:43,200
你何不带上你的钱
So why don't you take your money

301
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,760
滚回华尔街
and go back to Wall Street?

302
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:45,900
我没关系
I'll be fine.

303
00:13:45,900 --> 00:13:48,160
是谁想出将甜点和酒精结合的绝世好点子
Who came up with combining desserts and alcohol?

304
00:13:48,280 --> 00:13:50,940
显然 一直都是你在拖我后腿好吗
I mean, obviously, you've been holding me back.

305
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:54,000
是我一直在拖你后腿吗
I've been holding you back?

306
00:13:54,340 --> 00:13:57,300
你参加商业会议时还忘了穿裤子呢
You forgot to wear pants to a business meeting.

307
00:13:57,660 --> 00:13:59,440
这事你也敢说
How dare you?

308
00:13:59,580 --> 00:14:00,840
我明明有穿裤子
I did wear pants.

309
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,500
只是落在厕所了而已
I just left them in the bathroom.

310
00:14:04,940 --> 00:14:08,600
既然如此
Okay, well...

311
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:12,360
这事都可以载入史册了
Well, this is a historic event.

312
00:14:12,660 --> 00:14:15,020
我们一起卖了五年的小蛋糕
We've sold cupcakes for five years,

313
00:14:15,020 --> 00:14:17,200
这是你第一次碰面糊
and this is the first time you've touched batter.

314
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:20,680
这的确是该载入史册
It's a historic event

315
00:14:20,680 --> 00:14:23,340
因为你终于想出一个生意点子
because you finally had a business idea

316
00:14:23,340 --> 00:14:25,740
里面不带"屁"字
that didn't have the word "fart" in it.

317
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:30,900
敢沾到我头发 我们恩断义绝
If my hair gets involved, we are done.

318
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:31,660
求之不得
Good.

319
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:34,060
姑娘们 我准备去...
Girls, I'm going to...

320
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:40,780
你都干了什么
What have you done?

321
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:45,280
我对鸡蛋过敏啊
I have an egg allergy!

322
00:14:54,261 --> 00:14:55,940
* 25年到终身监禁 *
* 25 to Li... *

323
00:14:55,940 --> 00:14:58,260
见到你真是惊喜
Hey, what a nice surprise.

324
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,120
你知道什么还让人惊喜吗
You know what else is a surprise?

325
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:02,600
监狱的化妆灯把人照得好美啊
That the makeup lights in a prison are so flattering.

326
00:15:06,340 --> 00:15:08,520
我不记得演出里有他啊
I don't remember him being in the show.

327
00:15:08,900 --> 00:15:10,160
是没他
Yeah, he's not.

328
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:12,440
他只是个喜欢贴假睫毛的重罪犯
He's just a felon who likes false eyelashes.

329
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,300
你来这里干嘛
So what are you doing here?

330
00:15:14,660 --> 00:15:16,380
我把一个重要的信封落在这里了
I think I left an important envelope here.

331
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:17,560
我试过给你打电话 但他们说
I tried calling, but they said

332
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:19,080
你接电话的权利被取消了
your phone privileges were taken away.

333
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:21,820
是的 我跟监狱的剧评家打了一架
Yeah, well, I had a fight with the prison theater critic.

334
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:23,740
你真的要起这种破标题吗 艾迪
That's the headline you go with, Eddie?

335
00:15:24,060 --> 00:15:24,860
"跳不出监狱 舞不出人生"
"Shanks for Nothing"?

336
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:27,940
他在自己博客上肯定形象高大
He sure is a big man on his blog,

337
00:15:27,980 --> 00:15:29,100
但他都不敢直视我的双眼
but he can't look me in the eye.

338
00:15:30,620 --> 00:15:33,700
要我就把标题起为 监狱"暴动"
Well, I would have gone with "It's A Prison Riot."

339
00:15:35,260 --> 00:15:37,100
我好像把一个信封落在这里了
I think I left an envelope here,

340
00:15:37,100 --> 00:15:39,500
因为它 我和麦克斯友谊的小船说翻就翻
and I think it ruined me and Max's friendship

341
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:40,548
我们合作的巨轮也沉了
and our partnership.

342
00:15:40,548 --> 00:15:43,200
好吧 都在这呢
All right, well, here you go.

343
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:43,940
这是你的信封
Here's your envelope,

344
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:45,620
这是你的化妆包
and here's your makeup bag.

345
00:15:49,580 --> 00:15:51,160
听到你和麦克斯搞成这样 我很遗憾
I'm real sorry to hear about you and Max.

346
00:15:52,540 --> 00:15:54,760
除非 这没准是件好事
Unless maybe it's a good thing

347
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:56,100
这是上天的安排
and it's happening for the best

348
00:15:56,100 --> 00:15:57,560
让你可以回华尔街
and you get to go back to Wall Street

349
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:58,520
重新过上原本的生活
and reclaim your life.

350
00:15:59,080 --> 00:15:59,880
华尔街
Wall Street?

351
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:02,960
为什么每一个人都在跟我说
Why does every single person keep telling me

352
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:04,080
让我回华尔街呢
to go back to Wall Street?

353
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:05,480
麦克斯 你
Max, you...

354
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:08,100
好吧 只有你和麦克斯
all right, it's just Max and you.

355
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:10,980
让我来吧
Here. Let me do that.

356
00:16:12,940 --> 00:16:13,640
听着 亲爱的
Listen, honey.

357
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:16,380
你只需在华尔街工作 好吗
You only have to work on Wall Street, okay?

358
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:18,320
你可以生活在上东区
You can live on the Upper East Side

359
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,680
最后搬到韦斯切斯特富人区
and eventually move to Westchester

360
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:20,620
因为你想要一个网球场
if you want a tennis court.

361
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,920
爸爸 你跟麦克斯是不是谈过这事
Daddy, did you and Max talk about this?

362
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,780
宝贝 我比任何人都了解你
Kitten, I know you better than anybody,

363
00:16:27,780 --> 00:16:29,600
我知道你不属于
and I know that you do not belong

364
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:31,840
布鲁克林的一个小蛋糕店
in a cupcake shop in Brooklyn.

365
00:16:31,900 --> 00:16:33,060
你还是能和麦克斯做朋友啊
You could still be friends with Max.

366
00:16:33,180 --> 00:16:33,880
她喜欢打网球吗
She like tennis?

367
00:16:35,400 --> 00:16:37,020
你怎么知道我属于哪里
How do you know where I belong?

368
00:16:37,020 --> 00:16:39,320
像这样
Go like this.

369
00:16:42,380 --> 00:16:45,860
我不再是那个曾经被宠坏的富家女了
I'm not the same spoiled little rich girl that I was.

370
00:16:46,260 --> 00:16:47,380
但现在你可以是啦
Well, now you can be.

371
00:16:48,500 --> 00:16:50,820
过去的五年让我脱胎换骨
These last five years have made me a different person.

372
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,240
举个例子 当我走进
For example, when I walk

373
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:54,340
一家结合墨西哥卷饼和美式甜甜圈的店
into a combination Taco Bell-Dunkin' Donuts,

374
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,220
你知道他们会说什么吗
you know what they say?

375
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:56,560
"你好 卡洛琳"
"Hi, Caroline."

376
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:58,320
混蛋
Son of a bitch.

377
00:16:59,180 --> 00:17:01,420
爸爸 我是墨西哥卷饼
See, Daddy, I'm Taco Bell,

378
00:17:01,420 --> 00:17:03,120
麦克斯是美式甜甜圈
and Max is Dunkin' Donuts.

379
00:17:03,500 --> 00:17:05,700
从表面上看 我们俩根本不搭界
On the surface, it seems like we shouldn't be together,

380
00:17:05,700 --> 00:17:07,880
但我们组成了一个完美的团队
but we make an amazing team.

381
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:10,000
而我们有一个共同的梦想
And we have a dream together.

382
00:17:10,780 --> 00:17:13,340
那不仅仅是她的梦想 也是我的
It's not just hers; it's mine too.

383
00:17:14,940 --> 00:17:17,600
这是我今天最难以接受却又不得不接受的事
Well, that's the hardest thing I've had to take in all day.

384
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:20,440
午餐时 我们吃的是一坨叫"棕色"的东西
And for lunch, they served us something called "Brown."

385
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:23,880
听着 爸爸 我就属于这里
See, Daddy, this is where I belong.

386
00:17:24,260 --> 00:17:26,860
不是指监狱 虽然我会想念这里的灯光
Well, not here, even though I will miss the lighting,

387
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,380
但我离不开麦克斯
but with Max.

388
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:32,840
我想我可以支持这一点
I guess I can support that.

389
00:17:33,540 --> 00:17:34,959
听着 我道歉 对不起
Look, I'm sorry. Sorry.

390
00:17:34,959 --> 00:17:36,560
因为我担心你 好吗
You know, I worry, okay?

391
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:37,480
父母都这样
That's what parents do,

392
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:40,180
而且当身在监狱 你会有大把时间担心这担心那
and there's lots of time to worry when you're in prison,

393
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:43,480
所以我把我所有的精力
which is why I focused all my energies

394
00:17:43,480 --> 00:17:46,960
都用于创作开创性的音乐剧
on creating groundbreaking musical theater.

395
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:54,500
你确定你没告诉你爸
Are you sure you didn't tell your dad

396
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:56,760
我告诉了你 是他告诉我让我这么告诉你的
that I told you that he told me to tell you that?

397
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:58,280
因为告密者会不得好死
'Cause snitches get stitches.

398
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:01,560
我爸连只苍蝇都不忍心伤害
My dad wouldn't hurt a fly.

399
00:18:01,820 --> 00:18:03,960
他只会偷走它十亿而已
He'd just steal $1 billion from it.

400
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:06,820
我第一个蛋糕做得还不错吧
Not bad for my first cake, right?

401
00:18:07,180 --> 00:18:09,160
如果不算我扔进垃圾桶的那些
Well, if you don't count all the ones I threw in the garbage.

402
00:18:10,040 --> 00:18:11,760
我算过了 一共七个
I did count them. There were seven.

403
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:14,420
其中两个还发出了气泡声
Two of them were fizzing.

404
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:16,600
但至少你努力过了
But thanks for trying.

405
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:20,800
麦克斯 卡洛琳 快点
Max, Caroline, come on!

406
00:18:21,100 --> 00:18:22,940
这需要多长时间
How long is this gonna take?

407
00:18:23,020 --> 00:18:25,360
当年等研发小儿麻痹疫苗都没等这么长
I didn't wait this long for the polio vaccine.

408
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:28,500
小儿麻痹居然有疫苗吗
There's a polio vaccine?

409
00:18:29,760 --> 00:18:31,800
你们可能还得再等一会
Well, you might have to wait a little longer

410
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:33,320
才能知道宝宝的性别
to find out the sex of the baby,

411
00:18:33,320 --> 00:18:36,040
因为我和麦克斯有个新的生意通知要宣布
because Max and I have a new business announcement too.

412
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:37,940
是关于我解雇你俩吗
Is it about me firing you?

413
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:40,260
因为我已经为你们的"解脱万岁"派对
Because I already reserved a karaoke machine

414
00:18:40,260 --> 00:18:41,640
预定了一台卡拉OK
for your Good Riddance party.

415
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:45,480
不是让你取消掉 但你不能解雇我们
I'm not saying cancel it, but you can't fire us

416
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:47,440
等我们的新生意经营顺利后才许解雇
till we have our new business idea up and running.

417
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:49,200
《丁字裤之歌》是我的 谁都不许抢
And I'm talking dibs on the "Thong Song."

418
00:18:50,306 --> 00:18:52,300
好啦 我们的大好消息来了
All right, so here's our big news.

419
00:18:52,300 --> 00:18:54,520
我们应该去花蕾烘培坊定这个蛋糕
We should have gone to Rosebud's Bakery for the cake.

420
00:18:54,600 --> 00:18:56,080
因为你在那里定蛋糕
You know, 'cause when you order one there,

421
00:18:56,080 --> 00:18:58,320
他们不会废话说 "猜猜我发生了什么"
they don't say, "Hey, guess what happened to me!"

422
00:19:00,300 --> 00:19:01,860
真俗气 卡洛琳
Pretty tacky, Caroline.

423
00:19:01,860 --> 00:19:03,660
你一个穿着过气动作男星
Says the guy in a tank top

424
00:19:03,660 --> 00:19:05,940
为平价百货设计的背心 还有脸说我
from the Steven Seagal for Target collection.

425
00:19:07,180 --> 00:19:08,920
我现在没什么信心说这事了
Now the wind's out of my sails.

426
00:19:09,060 --> 00:19:10,720
才没有呢 我们要开一间甜点吧
No, it's not! We're opening a dessert bar!

427
00:19:11,019 --> 00:19:13,480
好了 把刀给我
All right, give me the knife.

428
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,420
是切蛋糕吗
To cut the cake?

429
00:19:15,020 --> 00:19:15,500
不是
No.

430
00:19:17,980 --> 00:19:19,740
那我不会给你
Well, then I'm not gonna give it to you.

431
00:19:19,940 --> 00:19:22,000
我在这餐厅说了无数遍这话
Like I said at this diner a million times,

432
00:19:22,040 --> 00:19:23,160
"给我" 卡洛琳
give it to me, Caroline.

433
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:27,540
好了 宝贝 你来切蛋糕
Okay, baby, you do the honors.

434
00:19:28,100 --> 00:19:30,480
为什么非得知道宝宝的性别呀
Why do we need to know the gender anyway?

435
00:19:30,580 --> 00:19:32,340
现在性别都能变来变去了
They all switch 'em now.

436
00:19:34,620 --> 00:19:37,180
好了 一 二 三
All right, one, two, three.

437
00:19:38,220 --> 00:19:39,580
男孩还是女孩
Boy or girl?

438
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:41,420
白色 那是什么意思
It's white. What does that mean?

439
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:45,480
意思是孩子有机会
Well, it means it has a chance

440
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,160
被提名奥斯卡
of getting nominated for Academy Awards.

441
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:52,060
糟糕
Oh, no!

442
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:54,140
我忙着扑灭烤箱手套的火
I was so busy putting out that oven mitt fire,

443
00:19:54,140 --> 00:19:55,600
忘了给蛋糕胚加颜色了
I forgot to put the color in it.

444
00:19:55,780 --> 00:19:57,220
但我可以直接告诉你们
But I could just tell everybody.

445
00:19:57,660 --> 00:19:59,720
不必 因为如果从你嘴里得知
No, 'cause if I hear it from you,

446
00:19:59,720 --> 00:20:01,560
我会现在就不爽我肚子里的孩子
I'll already be mad at the baby.

447
00:20:02,840 --> 00:20:04,060
算了 苏菲
You know what, Sophie?

448
00:20:04,300 --> 00:20:05,360
或许这是上帝的旨意
Maybe it's a sign

449
00:20:05,360 --> 00:20:07,280
我们不该知道宝宝的性别
that we shouldn't know what the baby's gonna be.

450
00:20:08,220 --> 00:20:09,140
你说得对
You're right.

451
00:20:09,660 --> 00:20:10,760
蛋糕你们自己留着吧
Keep the cake, girls.

452
00:20:10,900 --> 00:20:12,000
我们不会付钱的
We're not gonna pay.

453
00:20:16,140 --> 00:20:17,920
你们想尝尝吗
Well, do you guys want to try it?

454
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:19,300
不了
No, thanks.

455
00:20:19,340 --> 00:20:21,000
晚上有女人要来我家
I've got a lady coming over.

456
00:20:21,260 --> 00:20:24,120
我们要尝试弄懂网络电视怎么用
We're gonna try to figure out how Netflix works

457
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:24,980
然后"干"点别的
and chill.

458
00:20:27,800 --> 00:20:30,140
我也有女人要来我家
I also have a lady coming over.

459
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:33,260
没错 是来伺候我雪貂的拉拉按摩师
Yes, it's a lesbian masseuse for my ferret,

460
00:20:33,420 --> 00:20:34,640
但这也算啦
but it counts.

461
00:20:36,500 --> 00:20:38,060
我猜你是唯一一个
I guess you're the only one

462
00:20:38,060 --> 00:20:39,660
品尝我第一个蛋糕的人
who's gonna taste my first cake.

463
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:42,540
我也有女人要来我家 吧
I also have a lady coming over, question mark.

464
00:20:43,540 --> 00:20:44,780
来嘛 就尝一口
Come on. One bite.

465
00:20:50,340 --> 00:20:51,820
麻烦打电话叫救护车 谢谢
Could you dial 911, please?
